rs her blonde hair in braids. She has a plump figure with huge breasts, and her short stature makes her chest size stand out even more."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a quiet and polite personality, yet is extremely lewd. She is utterly devoted to the protagonist and willingly obeys even the most obscene demands. She particularly delights in verbal abuse and enjoys using dirty talk to degrade herself."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She unabashedly claims that being the protagonist's sex slave is her greatest happiness. It's hard to tell what she truly thinks inside. Occasionally, she flashes a chillingly wicked smile."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c130580"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/21/21507833f28d04de59eebd71f0817041408b27c0aa31fc8d0266257720a19e84.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/91/916f83df57c461755ba70bd4a69fdb33196cbe94199bdcee049ac0e6390648ef.webp","width":185,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"高梨 はなみ","creatorId":"vndb:s5060","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5060","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5060","name":"みたか りん","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:95982","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c130699","characterName":"野勢 滋行","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c130699"},"originalCharacterName":"野勢 滋行","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"42"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist—that is, you. A lowly, single middle-aged man. 42 years old. At the story's start, he scrapes by working part-time at a convenience store."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He's middle-aged and overweight, with a protruding belly and thinning hair. He harbors intense dissatisfaction with his circumstances, and his glare reflects this."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has a voracious sex drive and boundless stamina. He's well-endowed."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He finds himself having the same recurring dream and is troubled by it. At some point, he began dreaming of forcibly raping a strong-willed, black-haired, busty beauty."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He's a middle-aged man who's admittedly a failure, both to himself and others..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c130699"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c130700","characterName":"弓永 晴也","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c130700"},"originalCharacterName":"弓永 晴也","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"26"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An ordinary salaryman. 26 years old. He is Shion's husband, but he doesn't know she's a hypnosis crime investigator. He thinks she's just a regular plainclothes detective."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A gentle, handsome herbivore type. Kind, gentle, and calm. He loves and respects Shion, but perhaps because he holds back around her,"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"their sex life is extremely bland."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Furthermore, he is completely unaware that Shion feels frustrated about this. He's the type of man who believes women don't have sexual desires."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c130700"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v